  "description": "SIBFUG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C24 H33 Cl1 O16 Yb3 3+,3(Cl1 1-),4(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.448-3.480 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.89-99.85°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C24H41Cl4O20Yb3. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 5 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
